---
title: Stuart meets Satoshi - who talks to whom
---

%% Stuart and Satoshi are peers in a p2p, Signal-like messaging channel.
%% Stuart rotates a key. Satoshi verifies the new key.
%% Solid arrows: on-chain data. Dashed arrows: off-chain data.

flowchart TD
    Stuart(["Stuart<br/>DID controller"])
    Beacon["BTCR2 Beacon<br/>Singleton, CAS, or SMT"]
    BTC[("Bitcoin")]
    Data[("Sidecar Data<br/>or CAS")]
    Satoshi(["Satoshi<br/>channel peer"])

    Stuart -->|"(1) announce the update"| Beacon
    Beacon -->|"Beacon Signal"| BTC
    Stuart -.->|"(2) update data"| Data
    Stuart -.->|"(3) message signed<br/>with the new key"| Satoshi
    BTC -->|"(4) resolve the DID"| Satoshi
    Data -.-> Satoshi
